; $C407 `enemySolidityIndex`: tile ids below it are solid to an enemy. The
; `SOLIDITY` op's second column, stored at 00:$244E to `$D069` and copied to
; $C407 at the top of every enemy pass (02:$4082); nothing else writes either,
; so the port keeps the one byte and the op stores it directly.
